# RooFlow Memory Bank

Persistent context lives in `memory-bank/` (from [RooFlow](https://github.com/GreatScottyMac/RooFlow)).

## Files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `productContext.md` | Product goals, features, architecture |
| `activeContext.md` | Current focus, recent changes, open questions |
| `progress.md` | Completed / current / next tasks |
| `decisionLog.md` | Architecture decisions + rationale |
| `systemPatterns.md` | Coding / arch / test patterns |

## When to read

At the start of non-trivial work (architecture, multi-file features, continuing a prior thread), read at least `activeContext.md` and `productContext.md`. For patterns/decisions, also `systemPatterns.md` / `decisionLog.md`.

## When to update (UMB)

When the user says **Update Memory Bank**, **UMB**, or after a meaningful decision/milestone:

1. Append a timestamped note (`YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`) to the relevant file(s).
2. Prefer short factual bullets — do not rewrite the whole bank.
3. Put session clarifications in `activeContext.md` or `decisionLog.md`.

## Hosts

- **Cursor / Codex / Agent**: this rule + `memory-bank/` files.
- **Roo Code**: Flow-* modes in `.roomodes` + prompts in `.roo/` (install/update: `npm run rooflow:setup`).

Do not invent product facts that contradict `AGENTS.md` or `memory-bank/productContext.md`.
